{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block pageStyles %}
<style>
  .sym-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 24px 0; }
  .sym-list li { padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .sym-list a.sym-name { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .sym-list p { margin: 4px 0 0; }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "DefinedTermSet",
  "name": "Coffee cup reading symbols",
  "url": "https://randypellegrini.com/coffee-symbols/",
  "hasDefinedTerm": [
    {% for s in coffeeSymbols %}{ "@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": {{ s.name | dump | safe }}, "description": {{ s.short | dump | safe }}, "url": "https://randypellegrini.com/coffee-symbols/{{ s.slug }}/" }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
<div class="article-container">
  <div class="article-header reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Tasseography</p>
    <h1>Coffee Cup Reading Symbols</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="article-body reveal delay-1">
    <p>Every shape in the grounds has a traditional reading, and where it sits in the cup changes what it means. These pages cover one symbol each: the common meaning, how position shifts it, and the variations readers look for. Meanings differ between the Turkish, Greek and Levantine traditions, so treat them as a starting point for a conversation rather than a verdict.</p>
    <ul class="sym-list">
      {% for s in coffeeSymbols %}
      <li><a class="sym-name" href="/coffee-symbols/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }}</a><p>{{ s.short }}</p></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p>The full method, including the ritual, the three zones of the cup and thirty common symbols, is in the <a href="/blog/how-to-read-coffee-grounds/">guide to reading coffee grounds</a>.</p>
    <div class="sym-try" style="text-align:center; margin: 32px 0 8px;">
      <a class="button" href="/read-your-grounds/">Get a free reading of your grounds &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
